title: "CultureTechLens Black Cultural Knowledge Graph"
type: dataset
version: "2.0"
date-released: 2026-10-28
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23403147
license: CC-BY-4.0
authors:
  - family-names: Maxey
    given-names: William
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-2837-8037"
    affiliation: "CultureTechLens NFP"
  - name: "CultureTechLens NFP"
abstract: >-
  One record per person, place, work, institution, event, and practice in Black
  culture — Chicago first. Version 2.0 is the union of CultureTechLens's
  canonical master store and build graph (7,530 entities, 7,998 relationships),
  with grades carried per store, all 576 preserved disagreements disclosed,
  and 832 rights-documented photographs with per-image evidence records.
keywords:
  - Black culture
  - Chicago
  - knowledge graph
  - cultural heritage
  - dataset
repository-code: "https://culturetechlens.com/graph/"
